text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Sana. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Sana, I am Priya Gupta and I am absolutely fed up with my internet connection. It has been dropping every ten minutes for the last two days!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you are experiencing these drops, Ms. Gupta. I know how frustrating it is when your connection is unstable.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "It is making it impossible to work from home. I just want this fixed now.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can certainly look into this for you. Before we access your account details, could you please provide your account number and date of birth?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "My account number is 62809304 and my date of birth is 22/12/1989.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you. I am checking the line diagnostics now. I see some signal instability in your area. To make sure we get this sorted, I need to verify your contact details. Is your phone number 92571 77606 and email priya.13@examplemail.com?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, those are correct.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I have run a remote reset on your port, which should stabilize the connection. Could you please check if the internet is working now?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Wait, let me see... oh, it seems to be back up and the speed looks much better. Thank you so much, Sana!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am glad to hear that. However, to ensure the stability is permanent, I will raise a network ticket for our engineers to monitor the line for the next twenty-four hours.",
      "tags": [
        "action:technician_or_ticket"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
